WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:07.120
What is the Creator telling us through the storm that erupted in Israel over the film «NAZA» by Yuval Abraham and Rachel Szor?

2
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:17.580
In recent days the internet has been in uproar over this film, which won at the Venice Festival and provoked an enormous wave of criticism, anger and condemnation — quite rightly, it must be said.

3
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:29.480
The painful feeling that arose among many in the people of Israel is an experience of betrayal by creators who sold out their people and their land in exchange for applause from an international audience that backs the pro-Palestinian lie.

4
00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:46.180
But in a complete reversal, this storm did exactly the opposite: it reawakened with renewed force, among many in the people of Israel, the sense of belonging, of loyalty, and of pride — in our Holy Land, in our remarkable soldiers, and in the strong and singular people of Israel.

5
00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:50.340
The people of Israel lives and endures — even when lies are spread about us in the world.

6
00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:58.560
In this video I want to focus on one particular verse that appeared in a great many posts, videos and comments accompanying the criticism of the film’s creators,

7
00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.360
from the prophecy of Isaiah, chapter 49:

8
00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:05.160
«Your destroyers and those who laid you waste shall go forth from you».

9
00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:10.720
The inner interpretation of the verse explains how it is precisely from within the people of Israel, from the Land itself,

10
00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.560
that the greatest destroyers and ravagers of our good name emerge and operate —

11
00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:22.600
exactly like the film’s creators. But this verse also has a remarkable plain-sense reading, which rises from the prophecy itself:

12
00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:30.300
the destroyers and ravagers «shall go forth from you» — that is, they shall go out of the Land, into exile.

13
00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:35.080
In an interview given by Yuval Abraham after the wave of criticism he took, he said:

14
00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.000
«The Land is my home. I am afraid I will not be able to return. What would I do abroad?»

15
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:56.520
What can you do — every Venice Festival also has a morning after. And as we know: whoever meddles, gets wrecked. Whoever slanders the Land and does not grasp the magnitude of the error — his end is to leave the Land and remain in exile.

16
00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:03.760
But what is even more fascinating to discover is the message the Creator conveys through the complete prophecy from which the verse is taken.

17
00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:11.960
The prophecy of Isaiah 49 is one of the most moving prophecies about the return to Zion at the End of Days, after the long years of exile.

18
00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:18.120
In this chapter the Creator speaks through the prophet to His beloved, Zion — that is, the Land of Israel.

19
00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:27.300
Zion is described there as a bride who feels lonely and forsaken, fearing that her beloved — the Holy One, blessed be He — has left her and will not return.

20
00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:37.460
The Creator comforts her and promises her that He remains faithful to her, and that He is going to bring all her sons and daughters back home from exile at the End of Days —

21
00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:42.400
our very own days. This is one of the most glorious prophecies of redemption.

22
00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:48.860
Do you realize that our very being here today in the Land, in the Land of Israel, is a direct fulfillment of this prophecy?

23
00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.840
But how does all this connect to the film at the Venice Festival?

24
00:02:53.340 --> 00:03:02.400
Notice this: «Venezia» (ונציה), rearranged, is «Tziona» (ציונה) — the joining of Zion with her original beloved, the Blessed Name.

25
00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:08.000
Let us look at the verses from the chapter and at the Creator’s message to the people of Israel and to the Land of Israel.

26
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:13.340
«And Zion said: the Lord has forsaken me, and my Lord has forgotten me».

27
00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:16.160
Zion fears that Hashem has forgotten her,

28
00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:20.360
and the Creator answers her: «Yet I will not forget you».

29
00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:24.700
«Behold, I have engraved you upon My palms; your walls are continually before Me».

30
00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.920
At the Venice Festival people stood and clapped their palms

31
00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:32.220
for those who defamed you, or who wish to divide you or hand you over to foreign hands.

32
00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:35.880
The Creator says: I will carry you upon My palms,

33
00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.540
and I will guard your walls with every watch.

34
00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:39.980
And then comes the verse:

35
00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:43.160
«Your children make haste; your destroyers and those who laid you waste

36
00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.600
shall go forth from you».

37
00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:48.220
I will see to it that everyone who tries to destroy and ravage you

38
00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.460
will in the end be exiled from the Land —

39
00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.220
exactly like those creators who now fear they will not be able to come back here.

40
00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:56.200
And the prophecy continues:

41
00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.200
«Lift up your eyes round about

42
00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.180
and see: they all gather together, they come to you.

43
00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:03.840
For you shall clothe yourself with them all as with an ornament,

44
00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.400
and bind them on as a bride does».

45
00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:09.920
Zion, the Land of Israel, the Assembly of Israel — she is the bride.

46
00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:12.480
We are the bride of the Divine Groom.

47
00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:16.360
While the world tries to level lies against us and to blacken our name,

48
00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.600
we remember our covenant of truth with the Creator

49
00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.460
and remain faithful to Him.

50
00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.900
We are not «Venezia» — we are «Tziona», the Zion of Hashem.

51
00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.240
The Land of Israel is the reference point

52
00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:30.860
through which the Divine truth is destined to be revealed to the whole world.

53
00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:47.500
The truth of the Torah will always defeat the lie, and no documentary film or manipulation of public opinion will change that. We need no prize and no applause — for «out of Zion shall go forth Torah, and the word of the Lord from Jerusalem».
